ongo</surname><given-names>FM</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Knowles</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Xie</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Massa</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Small molecule neurotrophin receptor ligands: novel strategies for targeting Alzheimer's disease mechanisms</article-title><source>Curr Alzheimer Res</source><year>2007</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>503</fpage><lpage>506</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18220511</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2174/156720507783018316</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ghosh</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Kumaragurubaran</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Hong</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Koelsh</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Memapsin 2 (beta-secretase) inhibitors: drug development</article-title><source>Curr Alzheimer Res</source><year>2008</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>121</fpage><lpage>131</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18393797</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2174/156720508783954730</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brunner</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Nestler</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Leahy</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>In need of high-throughput behavioral systems</article-title><source>Drug Discov Today</source><year>2002</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>S107</fpage><lpage>S112</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12546875</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1359-6446(02)02423-6</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>